                                    With one click GrowthBar scans hundreds of results in the Google SERP and generates an SEO-optimized outline for your blog or website — complete with optimal headings, keywords, word counts, internal links, and more. With another click, write your blog post with GrowthBar's AI writing assistant. Plus, you can audit your existing blog posts too!                                </p>

